  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0: seven new tools. line_get_webhook_info, line_test_webhook, line_get_delivery_stats and line_get_message_event_insight are read-only and do not count against the daily cap; line_list_liff_apps, line_create_liff_app and line_delete_liff_app manage LIFF apps and answer line.not_configured when the host has not called AddLineLiff. Creating and deleting a LIFF app change the account's configuration, so, like line_replace_rich_menu, they go through the review queue (new outbox kinds LiffCreate and LiffDelete, executed on approval; direct mode executes first and records afterwards) and the daily cap; listing is read-only. line_send_push, line_send_multicast and line_send_broadcast take an optional customAggregationUnit, stored with the outbox item and applied at approval time; items queued by 0.2.0 still approve unchanged. The review queue, the daily cap, the one-way outbox statuses and the 404 key gate are unchanged, and no existing tool was renamed. See https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Line/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
